OL,3,GNEWSATown council selling former public
OL,4,Atoilet block
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town council is selling a toilet
OL,7,Fblock that was permanently closed in
OL,8,F2018 by a sealed bid - as long as it
OL,9,Fapproves the planned use of the site.
OL,11,FWisbech Town Council said the property
OL,12,Fwas "surplus to requirements" and could
OL,13,Fbe used as a commercial enterprise.
OL,15,FThe closing date for the receipt of
OL,16,Fbids and proposals is 30 October.
OL,18,FPeople living locally welcomed the plan
OL,19,Fto bring the former convenience back to
OL,20,Flife in a new form, with suggestions of
OL,21,Fa cafe, coffee shop or opticians put
OL,22,Fforward.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
